# content/ IS tracked: it is produced locally by scripts/sync-content.py from
# the (private) Obsidian vault and committed. The sync script only ever copies
# what publish.list allows, so nothing outside the publish set can enter git.
# Run ./scripts/sync-content.py after editing notes, then commit.
